 "q-282143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 3 & -4 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 5 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-4 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 6\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-4)(6)-(1)(5))i-((3)(6)-(1)(-2))j+((3)(5)-(-4)(-2))k \\\\  & =(-24-5)i-(18+2)j+(15-8)k \\\\  & =-29\\,i-20\\,j+7\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "c67ab59a49029f9e2c4f22a62a9d91369e26fc6ab6019728ac68fd5c32866ba8" "basis" 1386 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-282143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2b0550090cc26f93266a7b0f166dd854d1a1cbe6f6ecc0508c6c1b68bfd5def3" "basis" 1386 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-282143" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/state.json" "file_sha256" "c67ab59a49029f9e2c4f22a62a9d91369e26fc6ab6019728ac68fd5c32866ba8" "basis" 1386 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039806/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-282143" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/ma